@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC10 — Select files and folders together
start
:Teacher opens Folder or File Settings;
:Moodle binds the native filemanager;
:Teacher filters and selects files / folders;
:CourseBridge retains selection across results;
:Teacher requests review;
:CourseBridge expands folders and checks
access, declarations, paths and upload limits;
if (Review can be applied?) then (yes)
  :Teacher adds reviewed materials;
  :CourseBridge rechecks the approval;
  if (Approval is still current?) then (yes)
    :Copy into the draft transactionally;
    if (Teacher saves?) then (yes)
      :Moodle saves the activity normally;
    else (cancel)
      :Saved activity remains unchanged;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Explain the change and require a new review;
  endif
else (no)
  :Explain blocked decisions;
  :Keep the selector available;
endif
stop
@enduml
